{"about_the_game":"Super Cat Herding: Totally Awesome Edition is a wacky physics sandbox game where you herd super-powered kittens, fight aliens, and destroy the world to solve the mystery of the missing catnip!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crazy Tools and Superpowers</h2>From laser pointers to the Kitten Cannon, over 15 tools and superpowers for you to experiment with!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459150/extras/3f7dd460853759142c2a6f25e6068c58.avif?t=1572317643\" width=626 height=78 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructible World, Popular References, Mean Robots, and Evil Aliens!</h2>Guide your superpowered minions to destroy nearly everything you encounter, all for a good cause, and a few laughs!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459150/extras/be3ac9e38445703516d0ed59fd77980f.avif?t=1572317643\" width=626 height=78 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Charity Contributions</h2>This would not have been possible without the existence of our kitten overlords, so 10% of every game sale goes to The Anti-Cruelty Society, as voted by the community.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459150/extras/ae2d0ff704a9e2dccd74abf4131ef1a9.avif?t=1572317643\" width=626 height=78 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keyboard/Mouse or VR</h2>Creating chaos with your keyboard and mouse works great, or get even closer to your menacing balls of fur in your Vive headset if that\u2019s how you roll!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459150/extras/223aa0593c3bc9c75e45c10e2d8bfe63.avif?t=1572317643\" width=626 height=78 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hilarious Outcomes</h2>Did we mention the tools and superpowers stack? Fire breathing kittens with jet packs? Check. Bouncy kittens hyped up on caffeinated treats? Done. What will you create?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459150/extras/5e68df408dd0dd7a79119303e27046bc.avif?t=1572317643\" width=626 height=78 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/459150?t=1572317643","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1572317643","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459150/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1572317643","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459150/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1572317643","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Super Cat Herding: Totally Awesome Edition is a wacky physics sandbox game where you herd super-powered kittens, fight aliens, and destroy the world to solve the mystery of the missing catnip!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crazy Tools and Superpowers</h2>From laser pointers to the Kitten Cannon, over 15 tools and superpowers for you to experiment with!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459150/extras/3f7dd460853759142c2a6f25e6068c58.avif?t=1572317643\" width=626 height=78 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructible World, Popular References, Mean Robots, and Evil Aliens!</h2>Guide your superpowered minions to destroy nearly everything you encounter, all for a good cause, and a few laughs!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459150/extras/be3ac9e38445703516d0ed59fd77980f.avif?t=1572317643\" width=626 height=78 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Charity Contributions</h2>This would not have been possible without the existence of our kitten overlords, so 10% of every game sale goes to The Anti-Cruelty Society, as voted by the community.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459150/extras/ae2d0ff704a9e2dccd74abf4131ef1a9.avif?t=1572317643\" width=626 height=78 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keyboard/Mouse or VR</h2>Creating chaos with your keyboard and mouse works great, or get even closer to your menacing balls of fur in your Vive headset if that\u2019s how you roll!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459150/extras/223aa0593c3bc9c75e45c10e2d8bfe63.avif?t=1572317643\" width=626 height=78 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hilarious Outcomes</h2>Did we mention the tools and superpowers stack? Fire breathing kittens with jet packs? Check. Bouncy kittens hyped up on caffeinated treats? Done. What will you create?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459150/extras/5e68df408dd0dd7a79119303e27046bc.avif?t=1572317643\" width=626 height=78 /></span>","developers":["ZoopTEK"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459150/header.jpg?t=1572317643","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2018 ZoopTEK LLC.  All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>